ot now",yF="Meet our AI assistant, Ask Learn",xx="Ask Learn is an AI assistant that can answer questions, clarify concepts, and define terms using trusted Microsoft documentation.",vF="Check for accuracy",xF="Ask Learn is in preview. Please check responses as AI-generated content may be inaccurate. Use the feedback buttons to help us improve the experience.",TF='Please read the <a class="text-decoration-underline" data-bi-name="02-link" data-bi-an="fre-modal" href="https://learn.microsoft.com/training/support/ask-learn-assistant-transparency-faq">Ask Learn transparency</a> notes to learn more about use cases and limitations.',wF="Try Ask Learn",tX="Acknowledgement",IA="To provide more relevant and personalized responses, Ask Learn stores your chat transcripts.",nX="Let Ask Learn use your past chats to personalize responses.",oX="Please check the box to acknowledge the guidelines before continuing.",rX="To use Ask Learn, you are required to acknowledge previous chat utilization. You can read more in the Ask Learn transparency notes.",sX="Review acknowledgements",_h="Please sign in to use Ask Learn.",iX='Sorry, I hit the maximum number of responses I can give in a conversation. Please select "New chat" to start a new conversation.',LA="More options",aX="Maximum {max} characters",yh="New chat",lX="See more",cX="New message from Ask Learn",vh="Preview",uX="Preview what will be shared",dX="Prompt guide",SF="Give as much detail as you can, but do not include any private or sensitive information",pX="Regenerate",mX="Send",gX="Stop generating",fX="Tell us more",PA="I'm currently experiencing high demand. Please try again in a few minutes.",hX="This message is helpful",bX="This message is not helpful",Tx=`Sorry, I can't help with that. Try the prompt guide by selecting the "View prompts" button below.`,ir="Sorry, something went wrong. Please try again or share your feedback.",_X="Some of the characters in your message aren't supported. Can you please try again using differen