refresh the page.",qpe="One or more milestones is empty or is missing the recommended days to complete. Please fix these issues before publishing the plan.",Hpe="Plan details",Bpe="Delete plan",zpe="To delete your plan, ensure no users are joined to it. All users must drop the plan first.",Gpe="Are you sure that you want to delete the following plan?",Vpe="Yes, delete plan",Fh="Invite learners",MO="Copy invite link",Qpe="Link copied to clipboard",jpe="Delete learning group",Ype="You are about to delete the following learning group: <strong>{learningGroupName}</strong>. Do you want to proceed?",Wpe="Group deleted",Kpe="Groups",Vx="Group name",Jpe="Individuals",Zpe="A learning group is a name that allows you to identify a group of learners in your progress report; learners will not see this name.<br/><br/>Creating a learning group generates a unique link to your plan for the specific group of learners.",$O="New learning group",Xpe="Please enter a name for this learning group",eme="Your invitation to start {planTitle} plan on Microsoft Learn",tme="Start your plan and begin your learning journey today.",nme="You have been invited to start the {planTitle} plan on Microsoft Learn.",ome="A plan is a set of curated and organized content on Microsoft Learn with milestones designed to help you to achieve learning outcomes.",rme="By completing this plan, you\u2019ll achieve the following learning outcomes:",sme="Start your plan today!",Oh="View progress",ime="Download this file to view a list of learners and their progress.",Qx="Download CSV",ame="The file contains the following information:",lme="Learner group",cme="Learn username",ume="Start date",dme="End date",pme="Items completed",mme="Items total",Pk="Learning outcomes",gme="Edit learning outcomes",fme="A learning outcome is specific knowledge, skills, or expertise that the learner will get from completing this plan.",hme="Tip: Begin each learning outcome with a verb. Each outcome should finish the sentence \u201CUpon completion of this plan, learners will be able to...\u201D",bme="Outcome 1",_me="Outcome 2 (optional)",yme="Outcome 3 (optional)",vme="Outcome {number}",xme="Convert to an official plan",Tme="Convert a plan to an official plan",wme="An official plan should be used when you want your plan to <strong>represent Microsoft</strong> and if you would like to include links that are external to Microsoft Learn. Always ensure that your plan is complete, free of typographical errors, and that content is in the correct sequence. <strong>Once an official plan is published, it cannot be altered.</strong>",Sme="To preserve any external links from an underlying Official Collection or plan, please convert to an official plan.",Cme="An official plan represents Microsoft, so please ensure that your published plan is complete, free of typographical errors, and that content is in the correct sequence.",Rk="This plan has been submitted to be localized",Eme="The plan is complete and proofread",Ame="Thank you for submitting your official plan for localization.",kme="Mark as completed",Mk="Milestone",Ime="Add milestone",Lme="Edit milestone";var Pme="New milestone",Rme="Days to milestone:",Mme="1 milestone",$me="{numberOfMilestones} milestones",Dme="Milestones in this plan",Nme="Milestone completed",Fme="Move to",Ome="Please confirm all milestones have a title and days to complete. You may need to expand each milestone.",Ume="Unsaved changes",qme="You have unsaved changes that may be lost if you exit now. To preserve your work, please click 'Cancel', then go back and save your changes.",Hme="Close without saving",Bme="Your changes will not be applied until you click the <strong>Save</strong> button.",zme="Mark as complete?",Gme="Do you want to mark it complete? Once you mark it as complete, you won't be able to review it again.",Vme="Welcome!",Qme="To start this plan, you have to share your plan progress data with the creator of the plan. The data that will be shared is: the dates that you start and complete the plan and how many items of the total you have completed at any point in time. Your data will be associated with your public Learn username.",jme="Do you agree to share your progress?",Yme="Yes, I agree to share my progress",Wme="If you would like to receive useful emails to guide and encourage you through your Plans journey, please go to your Profile Settings page and provide a contact email for notifications.",Kme="Save all items in this plan as a new",Jme="Please sign in to add this to your plan.";var Zme="You don't have any plans yet.",DO="A learner group with this name exists already. Please enter a different name",Xme="Violation detected",ege='Some text in this plan (title, description of the plan, milestone titles or description of milestones, or the learning outcomes) violates our <a href="/legal/termsofuse">Terms of Use</a> and have been deleted. If you have not yet published the plan, you can provide updated text in compliance with our <a href="/legal/termsofuse">Terms of Use</a> before publishing this plan.',tge="You will continue to see this alert until you made an update to your unpublished plan. If your plan is already published, you cannot make any updates.",nge="Reported plan",oge='A concern has been reported on this plan and it is currently under Microsoft review. Please refer to our <a href="/legal/termsofuse">Terms of Use</a> for more information.';var $k='Success! Your plan has been saved to your <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/users/me/activity/">profile</a>.';var NO="Redeem your code now.",rge="We could not copy your code at this time. Please try again.",sge="We could not copy your URL at this time. Please try again.",ige="It looks like you have already redeemed this code.<br/>Go to your achievements page to view your achievements.",age="You have hit your limit of 300 codes requested per day. Please try again after 12:00AM UTC.",lge="This code has hit its maximum.<br/>If you feel you are getting this message in error, please contact your instructor.",cge="We cannot find this code in our system. Please contact your instructor.",uge="Your code is ready to share!",dge="Code successfully copied!",pge="Copy code",mge="Copy this code to give to your students to redeem on Microsoft Learn";var gge="You must copy or write down this code. Once you close this modal you will not be able to look up this code.",Dk="Copy URL",fge="Copy this URL to send your students straight to code redemption",hge="Enter your code to add your achievement(s) to your profile",bge="Expiration date must be in the future",_ge="We could not create your code at this time. Please try again.",FO="We could not redeem your code at this time. Please try again.",yge="Add your achievement(s) to your profile",vge="Invalid achievement category",OO="Please enter a value between 1 and 100,000.",xge="OR",Tge="Redeem",Nk="Redeem your code",wge="e.g. A2CD34",Sge="It might take a couple of minutes for the badges to appear.",Cge="Codes are for our instructor-led training courses. Missing your code? Please contact your instructor.",Ege="Request achievement code",Age="Request code",kge="e.g. 50",Ige="Enter the number of students that will be redeeming this code",Lge="You are signed in as",Pge="We\u2019ve added your achievement(s) to your profile!",UO="More information on code",Rge="Please enter a value larger than 0",Mge="Please enter a valid code.",$ge="View profile",qO="Have an achievement code?";var Dge="Save your customized collection";var Fk="Schedule exam",Nge="Schedule with Certiport",Fge="Schedule with Pearson Vue";var HO="Microsoft provides this lab experience and related content for educational purposes. All presented information is owned by Microsoft and intended solely for learning about the covered products and services in this Microsoft Learn module.";var ns="Search";var Oge="Search Microsoft Learn";var BO="Search previous versions";var jx="Seconds",Uge="{duration} seconds ago",qge="{seconds} seconds",zO="Section";var Hge="See all activity";var Ok="See less";var wm="See more",Bge="Select",zge="Select a country or region";var Uk="Select Package";var qk="Select Version";var Sm="Settings",Hk="Share",GO="I earned my {achievementTitle} {achievementType}! I\u2019m so proud to be celebrating this achievement and hope this inspires you to start your own @MicrosoftLearn journey!",Yx="[Shared Article] {articleTitle}",Gge="I completed {achievementTitle}! I'm so proud to be celebrating this achievement and hope this inspires you to start your own @MicrosoftLearn journey!";var Cm="Share to your feed:";var VO="Share via";var Vge="Share your achievement:",Qge="Sharing",jge="Sharing is disabled for content requiring authorization.";var Bk="Show less",Em="Show more",Yge="Show {number} more",QO="Signed In",Fr="Sign in";var Wge="Signing in...";var Uh="Sign in to start",Am="Sign out";var Kge="Site";var Jge="Accurate/relevant content",Zge="Complete/clear content",Xge="Fast response",efe="Inaccurate/irrelevant content",tfe="Incomplete/unclear content",nfe="Offensive/inappropriate content",ofe="Slow response",jO="Something else";var rfe="Skills earned upon completion",YO="Skip";var sfe="Some items for you since your last visit",os="Hmm, something went wrong",Ft="Something went wrong. Please try again.";var km="GitHub";var bn="Start",ife="Starts {startDate}";var WO="Start course";var KO="Start learning path";var afe="Step {step-index} of {step-count}",lfe="Manage {title} in study guides",cfe="Add {title} in study guides";var co="Submit";var ufe="Submit another feedback",JO="Submit answers";var dfe="Successfully Submitted!",pfe="Thank you for submitting your feedback. We will review it shortly. Please note that feedback reporting is a one way communication and we are not responding back at this time.",mfe="Please note that although we cannot respond to feedback, our team will use your comments to improve the experience.";var gfe="Suggestions",ffe="Suggestions will filter as you type";var hfe="Support";var bfe="Table {index}";var _fe="Tags";var zk="Take Assessment",yfe="Characters left";var vfe="The file {fileName} is invalid. File type must be a valid gif, jpg, jpeg, or png image.",xfe="The file {fileName} is too large. File size cannot exceed five megabytes.",Tfe="Cloud Shell",wfe="{account} already has a profile",Sfe="You have reached your account limit",Cfe="No more than five school or work accounts can be linked to one profile. Please remove one account and try again.",Efe="{account} linked",Afe='To access your Learn profile, you must be able to sign in using at least one of the login accounts listed below. You may add up to five work or school login accounts <figure class="image is-24x24 display-inline-block"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/media/profile/aad-user.svg"/></figure>. Adding a work or school account allows you to share your learning progress data with your organization and take advantage of any organizational exam discounts. We strongly recommend adding a personal Microsoft login account <figure class="image is-24x24 display-inline-block"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/media/profile/msa-user.svg"/></figure> to your profile. This ensures that you maintain access to your learning history and credentials regardless of your employment or academic status. Only one personal login account is allowed.';var kfe="You already have a linked account in the same organization",Ife="Remove this account?",Lfe="Removing this account will delete its data from your Learn profile and stop the associated organization from receiving your Learn data. Note that your Learn profile will not be deleted.",Pfe="{account} removed",Rfe="Add login account",Mfe="Please add another account and try again.",$fe=`You can only link accounts that don't have a registered profile. Please select a different account or see our <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/support/troubleshooting#user-content-account-linking">troubleshooting guidance <span class="docon docon-navigate-external" aria-hidden="true"></span></a> for more details.`;var Dfe="Other Learn login accounts",Nfe="You are adding a school or work account ({account}) to your profile. You understand and acknowledge that we may share your results and activities with your organization. You may choose to unlink this account at any time and your organization will stop receiving your learning progress data.",Ffe="You have linked this account already",Ofe="{account} is a personal account. Please select a school or work account.",Ufe="Login account management",qfe="MCID",Hfe="You need at least one account linked to your profile.",Bfe="No accounts added",zfe="Only one account per organization is supported.",Gfe="You can only have one personal account linked",Vfe="Profile is currently being merged",Qfe="You can refresh the page to check the merge status.",jfe="Select account",ZO="Please select a different account",Yfe="Shared information (like name or picture) will keep the info from Profile 1.",Wfe="There is already a certification profile connected to this profile",Kfe="In order to continue, please contact customer support to remove the current certification profile to proceed.",Jfe="Your data will be <strong>merged into Profile 1</strong>.",Zfe="<strong>Editable information</strong> like your display name and interests can still be changed later.",XO="Notify me when merging is complete",Xfe="Merging profiles can take several minutes. We'll let you know when the process is complete. When you opt-in to this update, we may also send you personalized recommendations, helpful tips, or Q&A notifications.",ehe="You'll get notifications at {email}.",the="Your email is not currently set to receive notifications and will not be enrolled after the merge.",nhe='<a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/training/support/faq?pivots=profile">Learn more</a> about merging profiles.',ohe="This profile has been locked",rhe="This profile is currently locked and is being merged with another profile. Please sign-in to a different profile.",eU="Retry merge",tU="Terminate merge",she="Here's what will happen",ihe="Merge complete",ahe="Profile 1",lhe="Profile 2",che="You can refresh the page to check the merge status.",uhe="Profile merge record not found",dhe='Unable to find your profile merge. Please refresh the page. If the problem is still there, please contact <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/training/support/troubleshooting#report-feedback">customer support</a>.',phe="A previous merge attempt is preventing this action",mhe="One of the profiles you are trying to merge is currently being merged with another profile. Please log into both profiles to check the status.",ghe="You're combining two Microsoft Learn profiles.",fhe="Would you like to combine your learning data into one profile?",hhe="Merging your data is permanent and cannot be undone, but all your learning progress including achievements, skills, and certifications will be combined in one place.",bhe="Your profiles have been successfully merged.",_he="We ran into a problem merging your source profile (username: {sourceUser}) to your destination profile (username: {destinationUser}).",yhe="Some of your data might have been merged in the process, so it is expected if you find some data disappearing from your source profile and appearing on your destination profile.",vhe="You can choose one of the following actions:",xhe="<b>{terminateMergeText}</b>: It will stop and quit the merge process. You will be able to use both profiles as usual and can trigger a new merge at any time. The data that already merged will remain on your destination profile.",The="<b>{retryMergeText}</b>: It will re-run the merging process for you once more. Your source profile will be locked during the merging process.",whe="Merging in progress. It may take several minutes to complete.",She="Your merge has been terminated.",Che="Clicking 'Accept and continue' will begin t